%% Title: MediSearch End-to-End Data Lifecycle
flowchart TB
  Sources[External Pharmacy Sites, Public Drug Data, Pharmacy Exports] --> Raw[Backblaze B2 Raw Storage]
  App[Web Application Transactions] --> OLTP[(Main Neon OLTP Database)]
  Raw --> Cleaning[Cleaning: deduplicate, normalize, validate]
  Cleaning --> Staging[Backblaze B2 Staging Storage]
  Staging --> Transform[Transform: conform entities and build facts]
  OLTP --> Extract[Operational Extracts]
  Extract --> Transform
  Transform --> Warehouse[(Neon OLAP Warehouse)]
  Warehouse --> Analytics[Analytics and KPI Outputs]
  Warehouse --> AI[AI Feature Store]
  AI --> Models[Similarity Models and Recommendation Engine]
  Analytics --> Decisions[Admin and Pharmacy Decisions]
  Models --> UserExperience[Personalized Search, Alternatives, Alerts]
